  "hooks": [
    {
      "text": "捕捉并驯养生物后还能交配培育，以能力差异组建适合不同工作的伙伴队伍。",
      "dimension": "玩法",
      "excerpt": "As your settlement grows, you’ll breed different creatures together to create stronger companions with a diverse range of abilities and find the perfect team for whatever task you’re working on!",
