      "label": "证据原文片段"
    },
    {
      "text": "采集资源、解锁科技，并在生物伙伴协助下自由设计和扩建史前聚落。",
      "dimension": "玩法",
      "excerpt": "Gather resources, unlock new technologies, and freely design and expand your home base into a thriving settlement with the help of your creature companions!",
      "url": "https://store.steampowered.com/app/3336520/",
      "label": "证据原文片段"
    },
    {
      "text": "与恐龙伙伴共同完成播种、浇水、施肥和收获，逐步建成完整农场。",
      "dimension": "玩法",
      "excerpt": "Work hand-in-hand with your dinosaur companions to plant, water, fertilize, and harvest crops. Together, build a fully functional and flourishing farm.",
      "url": "https://store.steampowered.com/app/3336520/",
      "label": "证据原文片段"
